  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds read in the Nikon MakerNote printer\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2020-18771.patch: bound the nikonFocusarea[]\n       index in Nikon1MakerNote::print0x0088() with EXV_COUNTOF(), so a\n       crafted MakerNote cannot make the printer read a pointer from past\n       the end of the table (upstream 5e6c2855ce, via Debian DLA-3265-1).\n     - CVE-2020-18771\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds read in the native preview loader\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-27596.patch: require sizeData >= 28 in\n       LoaderNative::getData() before subtracting 28, so a Photoshop\n       preview IRB declaring a shorter payload cannot wrap the length to\n       nearly 4 GB (upstream 2cb728a850).\n     - CVE-2026-27596",
